t-align:center"><h2>Would you like a proposal for this system?</h2><p>Tell us about your organisation and the workflow you want to improve. We will prepare a proposal for your requirements.</p><a class="btn" href="lead-submit.php?product=<?= (int)$product['id'] ?>">Request a systems proposal</a></div></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap">© <?= date('Y') ?> SmarterNow Data Venture</div></footer></body></html>